@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam dpi 150
left to right direction
title DGM-USECASE-07 个人主页、账号与 Scholar 边界（V2.2 / 69 AC）
actor "访客" as Visitor
actor "注册用户" as User
actor "已授权 Scholar 管理者" as ScholarManager
actor "有权管理员" as Admin
rectangle "CognitaNexus" {
  usecase "UC-03 查看公开个人主页/学者档案" as ViewProfile
  usecase "UC-04 注册账号并生成主页" as Register
  usecase "UC-22 编辑本人普通个人主页" as EditProfile
  usecase "UC-05 提交和查询 Scholar 认领" as Claim
  usecase "UC-06 审核 Scholar 认领" as ReviewClaim
  usecase "UC-07 维护已授权 Scholar 档案" as MaintainScholar
  usecase "创建唯一 UserProfile 与稳定地址" as CreateProfile
}
Visitor --> ViewProfile
User --> Register
User --> EditProfile
User --> Claim
Admin --> ReviewClaim
ScholarManager --> MaintainScholar
Register ..> CreateProfile : <<include>>
CreateProfile ..> ViewProfile : 注册后公开可读
EditProfile ..> ViewProfile : 普通资料公开生效
Claim ..> MaintainScholar : 仅批准后授权
ReviewClaim ..> Claim : 审核决定
note bottom of Register
  AC-IMPL-FR04-03/04、FR03-03/04
  注册重试不产生第二主页
end note
note bottom of EditProfile
  AC-IMPL-FR06-03/04/05
  普通资料无需 Scholar 认领
  学术事实不能直接写入
end note
note bottom of Claim
  AC-IMPL-FR05-01～04
  认领不创建第二主页
  不批量确认 Authorship
end note
legend bottom
  普通 UserProfile 与 Scholar 档案是两个对象，不按同名合并。
  本图是 S02 用例局部视图，不替代总体用例图。
endlegend
@enduml
